# NOTE: keep small text artifacts (metadata.json, summary.json, *_metrics.json,
# metrics.csv, skill_summary.json) tracked. Large per-step actions.jsonl and
# frame PNGs should be reviewed before committing; prefer summaries in git and
# full traces synced to the server / results store.
